    "authorAssociation": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "How to add snippets until `mini.snippets` is ready.\r\n```\r\n    -- Snippets\r\n    {'L3MON4D3/LuaSnip'},\r\n    {'rafamadriz/friendly-snippets'},\r\n```",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">How to add snippets until <code class=\"notranslate\">mini.snippets</code> is ready.</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"    -- Snippets\n    {'L3MON4D3/LuaSnip'},\n    {'rafamadriz/friendly-snippets'},\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">    -- Snippets\n    {'L3MON4D3/LuaSnip'},\n    {'rafamadriz/friendly-snippets'},\n</code></pre></div>",
    "bodyText": "How to add snippets until mini.snippets is ready.\n    -- Snippets\n    {'L3MON4D3/LuaSnip'},\n    {'rafamadriz/friendly-snippets'},",
