            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Well, yes, by using some other plugins. These are good, I use 'L3MON4D3/LuaSnip' myself, but with manually managed snippets.\r\n\r\nIf you need more examples, here is [my Luasnip config](https://github.com/echasnovski/nvim/blob/master/lua/ec/configs/luasnip.lua) (has some hacks for showing if there is available snippet in Insert mode, as 'mini.completion' is not intended to show snippets) and here is [my snippet collection](https://github.com/echasnovski/nvim/tree/master/misc/snippets) (sourced from various sources, 'rafamadriz/friendly-snippets' being one of them).",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Well, yes, by using some other plugins. These are good, I use 'L3MON4D3/LuaSnip' myself, but with manually managed snippets.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">If you need more examples, here is <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/nvim/blob/master/lua/ec/configs/luasnip.lua\">my Luasnip config</a> (has some hacks for showing if there is available snippet in Insert mode, as 'mini.completion' is not intended to show snippets) and here is <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/nvim/tree/master/misc/snippets\">my snippet collection</a> (sourced from various sources, 'rafamadriz/friendly-snippets' being one of them).</p>",
