                    },
                    "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
                    "body": "> Can you suggest something for `friendly-snippets` instead of manually managed snippets?\r\n\r\nI am not sure I follow you here. The [rafamadriz/friendly-snippets](https://github.com/rafamadriz/friendly-snippets) is already a curated collection of snippets for various file types. You [install it](https://github.com/rafamadriz/friendly-snippets#install), [install LuaSnip](https://github.com/L3MON4D3/LuaSnip#install), make it [know about 'friendly-snippets'](https://github.com/L3MON4D3/LuaSnip#add-snippets) and [make some mappings](https://github.com/L3MON4D3/LuaSnip#keymaps). This should be enough to use them. ",
                    "bodyHTML": "<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Can you suggest something for <code class=\"notranslate\">friendly-snippets</code> instead of manually managed snippets?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I am not sure I follow you here. The <a href=\"https://github.com/rafamadriz/friendly-snippets\">rafamadriz/friendly-snippets</a> is already a curated collection of snippets for various file types. You <a href=\"https://github.com/rafamadriz/friendly-snippets#install\">install it</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/L3MON4D3/LuaSnip#install\">install LuaSnip</a>, make it <a href=\"https://github.com/L3MON4D3/LuaSnip#add-snippets\">know about 'friendly-snippets'</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/L3MON4D3/LuaSnip#keymaps\">make some mappings</a>. This should be enough to use them.</p>",
                    "bodyText": "Can you suggest something for friendly-snippets instead of manually managed snippets?\n\nI am not sure I follow you here. The rafamadriz/friendly-snippets is already a curated collection of snippets for various file types. You install it, install LuaSnip, make it know about 'friendly-snippets' and make some mappings. This should be enough to use them.",
